  "title": "Formalization of Carleson's theorem via the Lacey-Thiele approach",
  "abstract": "This is a Lean 4 formalization of Theorem 1.1 from the paper \"Bounds for anisotropic Carleson operators\" by J. Roos, which generalizes the Lacey-Thiele proof for Carleson's theorem. The classical Carleson theorem on pointwise almost everywhere convergence of Fourier series is derived as a special case.",
